{
  "spec": "exec protocol v1.4 sandbox job notify (crates/agent/src/exec_endpoint.rs, \"Sandbox job notify (v1.4)\"), \"keep with notify\"",
  "notes": [
    "cases: the notify member of one keep request (the rest of the request is template), and whether a conforming endpoint accepts it. Refused: the answer is 400 and nothing is recorded, so a list afterwards reports the job exactly as before (not kept, no notify). refusal names the rule broken, for a human reading a failure."
  ],
  "template": {
    "command": "true",
    "args": [],
    "timeout_ms": 30000,
    "job": {
      "op": "keep",
      "scope": "2ff302a37e7401aa95f92ec6c431944a",
      "id": "0123456789abcdef",
      "num": 3,
      "kind": "background",
      "seen": 120
    }
  },
  "cases": [
